<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2KƆ - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">2 KƆLINTƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan wàyweel akà Akɔlintɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 KƆLINTƆ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kɔ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan wàyweel akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akɔlintɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan wàyweel akà baar a Ebɛlyɔ, Pɔl wa kàsön umpal kàdiimà un'kaan kàsön nde kusà. Wa Titɔ kàsyen. Un'kaan wàyweel awà, nde kàkäb abà: Sɛmà kab làtàtwɛb tii lànsambwaar, ma màtɛɛnà ntɔn un'tüüb a Pɔl mpa kàkäl balàbal anà baar mpa bàkwen isal ande u Kɔlintɔ. Sɛmà kab lànaan tii làwà ma màtɛɛnà kiin a ndaa ayà kàkäl Pɔl ayà. Ma itɛɛnà naa: ndaa an'kab amà bàyilà kà Ikööŋ a Angɛlɛki, u Masɛdwan anà akà Azi Minɔ̈ɔ̈r ntɔn Ikööŋ akyà u Yɛlusàlɛm. Sɛmà kab làkwem tii làkwem aŋitär, ma màtɛɛnà ntɔn nkyeen a Pɔl u bul a Kɔlintɔ ntɔn muswaŋ isal a Nzam kàkyer nde. Mfun a un'kaan wàyweel awà yà ntɔn muduub un'lwaaŋ a ndääb a ndääb: ndaa ayàyàlyaaŋ, ndaa ayà apanà,ndaa ayà iyàyà. Ba ya bàyàman unsà ngyeel kàpɛ nde ilää. Un'kaan awà nde kàmay unsà làkyän anà mulɔm akà baar a Kɔlintɔ muman un'sak unsà kab a ngway a Nzam, unsà ukwen anà un'tüüb anà nde.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Pɔl, ntööm a Klistɔ Yɛsu unsà ukwen a Nzam, anà un'tɔŋ Tumàtɛ, akà Ikööŋ a Nzam akyà u Kɔlintɔ, anà akà aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà abà u Akayi wanswà.<verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Wɛy Taaràbi Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ bàlapɛ kab a ngway anà duu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl kan'fuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Nsaak ikäl akà Nzam, Taar a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ, Taa a nsyääm anà Nzam a ndɛɛl yanswà, <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>nde afàlɛɛl bi unsà mpay abi yanswà, ntɔn mukipà ngwal mulɛɛl baar abà u mpay mbɔɔn, u mbwo a ndɛɛl ayà ifàwal bi ŋakwo akà Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Ntɔn, asànaa ifàman bi mpay mbɔɔn amu Klistɔ, abun sye u mbwo a Klistɔ, ndɛɛl abi yà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Isàkal naa bi ibà uboo a mpay mbɔɔn, yà ntɔn ndɛɛl abɛ anà ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ. Isàkal naa bi ibà aŋàlɛɛl, yà ntɔn naa bɛ sye làwɛl ndɛɛl ntɔn bɛ làkwe mukaŋ mpem anà muküünà, ifà imwɛy a mpay ifàman bi. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Abun, bi ibye anà làkyän a ngwal akà bɛ, ntɔn bi ikyàyöb naa làmanà bɛ mpay mbwo mwɛy anà bi, bɛ sye làwalà ndɛɛl mbwo mwɛy anà bi.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Atɔŋ, ntɔn bi ikwen naa bɛ làyöb naa mpay aŋàdiir nà bi kàbweey ayà kà Azi: ya yàkü kir, yàŋàlyaŋ ngwal abi ukwɛl, lalan ilwom ya làkyän mufàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Bi kàmɛn amu bi ŋakwo naa bàmitsüül mbar a ukwà. Ntɔn bi ikɔ̈ɔ̈n afàsà làkyän amu bi ŋakwo, wɛɛ amu Nzam afàwiiy akü. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Nde mbuur kàduum bi kukwà abà anà akyer afàsiduum. Bi kan'sà làkyän amu nde: nde bi akyer afàsiduum. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Bɛ sye làkyàbilà mwo u mbwo a ngyamàkà abɛ ntɔn bi. Abun, kab a ngway alisàwal bi u mbwo a ngyamàkà a baar mbɔɔn, làsàbulà, ntɔn bàmbɔɔn, an'tɔɔn ntɔn bi. <verse eid="2CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Ntɔn, ngaal abi yimbäl a an'kyän abi aki: u mɛɛn, sin sin akà bɛ, bi kàkäl unsà ndandaa anà unsà un'kyɛɛl a Nzam, kà nà an'yeerà a imbuur anki, wɛɛ u mbwo a kab a ngway a Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Kyakin, bi indiir asin bɛ ifàlasöön anki, nà indiir làfàtaŋ bɛ anà làyöb bɛ. Wɛɛ mɛ an'sà làkyän naa bɛ làsàyöb aŋàkwo, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>ntɔn bɛ làyöb ndam: bi ibà ngaal abɛ, asànaa làbà bɛ yà bi kilä a Mwol Yɛsu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Unsà kam alan, mɛ kàkwen mutàlyaŋ akà bɛ ntɔn mukàlawɛɛl kab a ngway làyweel, <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>anà, fà apà bɛ, mɛ in'kyen Masɛdwan, anà fà Masɛdwan mufyefurà akà bɛ, ntɔn muwal akà bɛ indiir in'yàkal mɛ abyà mfun mukyà Yuday. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Umpal kàsi mɛ un'yɔŋ awà, nkye mɛ kàkyer upool? Itàkal naa nkye nswaal amɛ yà yimbuur, ntɔn ya ikäl umbalà mwɛy « inye » anà « ŋaa »? <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Nzam awà lää, wà mbäl: Ndaa itɛɛnà bi a bɛ kà yumbalà mwɛy « inye » anà « ŋaa » anki. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Ntɔn Mwan a Nzam, Klistɔ Yɛsu awà kàlakyään bi, Silàvɛ, Tumàtɛ anà mɛ, kàkäl anki « inye » anà « ŋaa », wɛɛ amu nde yà « inye » mpɛl. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Abun, ilää a Nzam byanswà, byàmɛn « inye » a bya amu nde. Kyakin mbwo ande sye bi ifàtɛn naa « yabwɛy » akà Nzam ntɔn làkoo ande. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Wɛɛ, mbuur afàpà bi anà bɛ ngwal amu Klistɔ anà kisi an'kɔɔ, wà Nzam, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>nde mbuur kibɛɛrà inyɛm ande sye anà kàbiil Dweelà u mpem abi asànaa mbööl a indiir aŋàbwaŋ abyà iyàyà. <verse eid="2CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Akà mɛ, mɛ an'wal Nzam mbäl udu a mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ: ntɔn mukàlatii waa mɛ mpa kàyàfurà u Kɔlintɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Kà ntɔn muyaal làkwikilà abɛ anki, wɛɛ bi ibà mbaay ntɔn un'sak abɛ, ntɔn làkwikilà waa bɛ lan'tsim.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Ntɔn, akà mɛ, mɛ an'tsülà abà: Mɛ in'yàfurà anki akà bɛ unsà ngyɛb. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Isàkal naa mɛ amàlasà u ngyɛb, nà afàsampà un'sak? Nkye kà mbuur awà kàpɛ mɛ ngyɛb anki? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Akin isin a ndaa a un'kaan amɛ, mutiin naa u ngyeel amɛ, mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n aman ngyɛb akà baar bàlan'pà un'sak. Ndandaa, mɛ an'kyey, ntɔn bɛ, naa un'sak amɛ wà wàbɛ banswà sye. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Abun, uboo a mpay aŋàdiir, anà u mpem a ngyɛb anà nsaaŋ mbɔɔn, mɛ kàlasöön kà ntɔn mukàlapà ngyɛb anki, wɛ ntɔn bɛ làyöb naa ukwen nà mɛ in'we abà ntɔn bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwääl a nkul a mbuur kan'kyer ube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kàkäl isin a ngyɛb, nde kà mɛ usi anki u ngyɛb, wɛɛ bɛ banswà, taaŋ lumwɛy ndam, mukɔɔn asweey. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Ntɔn mbuur atub awà, ubwaŋ pɛl làkäl là baar mbɔɔn, <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>lalan, apanà, lun'dwääl nkul anà lun'pɛ ngwal, manà nde ubilà u ngyɛb aŋàdiir. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Kyakin sye mɛ amàlalɔm, muswaŋ ukwen abɛ akà ande, <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>ntɔn, kàlasöön mɛ sye, mɛ kàkwen mukàlasi naa nkye unkyeey abɛ unsà indiir byanswà wàŋàkwo. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Mbuur lan'dwääl bɛ nkul, mbuur in'dwääl mɛ sye nkul! Isàkal naa mɛ kàdwääl nkul, ikäl sye naa mɛ kàkäl anà ipöl mukyer abun, mɛ kàkyer ntɔn bɛ, kusà a Klistɔ, <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>ntɔn Satanà mukɔɔn akikur, ntɔn bi ikyàyöb an'kyän ande.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyɛɛr a Pɔl u Tɔlɔwas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Utaaŋ kàkɔlà mɛ Tɔlɔwas ntɔn mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Klistɔ, itàkal naa Mwol kan'duub mbwo a kölàköl, <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>mpem amɛ yàkäl anki a duu, ntɔn mɛ un'tɔŋ amɛ Titɔ kun'mɛn anki. Abun laa kàsawɛy mɛ, waa kàkyen Masɛdwan. <verse eid="2CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Wɛy an'tɔɔn màkäl akà Nzam afisyen taaŋ lanswà unsà iböŋ ande u mbwo a Klistɔ anà u mbwo abi, afàtsul may a usɔŋ a ngyööb ande u mper yanswà. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Ntɔn bi ibà ntɔn Nzam, usɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ a Klistɔ, ntɔn baar bàfàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà ntɔn baar bàfàdiimà, <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>ntɔn bamwɛy usɔŋ a ukwà bàfàsyen kukwà, ntɔn bumwɛy, usɔŋ a mɔ̈ɔ̈ bàfàsyen u mɔ̈ɔ̈. Abun, nà kan'kwo unsà isal atub aki? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Abun, bi kibà anki asànaa baar bumwɛy bàfàyälà ndaa a Nzam, wɛɛ unsà ndandaa, kikɔb a Nzam, kusa a Nzam, unsà Klistɔ waa bi iyäämà.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkwà akün</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Nkye bi ifàsɛmà muswɛɛŋ bi ŋakwo? Itàkal naa nkye bi iwe anà mfun, asànaa bumwɛy, yà in'kaan muswɛɛŋ ntɔn bɛ, itàkal myàfà akà bɛ? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Wɛɛ bɛ làbà un'kaan abi, bàsön uboo a mpem abi, awà bàyöb anà bàtäŋ baar banswà. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Inye, yà ndandaa naa bɛ làbà un'kaan a Klistɔ bàsön ntɔn isal abi, bàsön anki anà tiin, wɛɛ anà Dweelà a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈, kudu a mɛsà a nkɔŋ anki, wɛɛ udu a mɛsà a in'twaŋ, udu a mpem. <verse eid="2CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Lalà kam iwà bi alà kusà a Nzam u mbwo a Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Bi ikyey anki uyɔl naa bi ŋakwo kan'kwo mukyer undiir mwɛy u ngwal abi ŋakwo, wɛɛ ngwal abi yan'fà akà Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Nde sye mbuur kibuul bàŋàkwo mukal asyääl a Nkwà akün, kà ntɔn un'kaan anki, wɛɛ ntɔn Dweelà, ntɔn un'kaan akyer afàdwa, wɛɛ Dweelà afàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="2CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Kyekà, isàkal naa isal a ukwà, bàsön a ngɔk udu a in'kul kyàpɛ làkoo, abun baar a Isàlɛl bàkwe anki musyebà mbɔɔn ntabwey a Mɔsɛ ntɔn làkoo làkäl u ntabwey ande, làkoo mpa làläm. <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>Ntɔn nkye isal a Dweelà mpa ikal kya anà làkoo aŋàsöönà? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Isàkal naa isal ifàpà ntaaŋàmbar kyàkäl anà làkoo, ntɔn nkye isal a balàbal mpa iwal kya làkoo aŋàsöönà? <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Abun, undiir kàkäl anà làkoo kàwɛl anki làkoo, ntɔn làkoo aŋàbà làŋàsöönà. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa undiir mpa afàlam kàpɛ làkoo, aben undiir afàlam mpa upà wa làkoo aŋàsöönà? <verse eid="2CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Ntɔn bi ibye anà làkyän atub alà, waa bi iwe anà làkyän a mbɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Bi ikyer anki asànaa Mɔsɛ kàfafwee ntabwey ande a ipfɛy a swaa ntɔn baar a Isàlɛl bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n aman ntsüü a un'nyäŋ mpa afàlam. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Wɛɛ, un'yɛnà aba kàkäl aŋàbwà làpib, tii ŋàbawà, kya bàsàtaŋ Nkwà Itaan, làpib alà là kapaa. La ŋàtàlwomà anki, ntɔn la làsàyaalà amu Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Inye, tii ŋàbawà, taaŋ lanswà bàfàtaŋ ba Mɔsɛ, làpib là u mpem aba. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Wɛɛ mbuul a mpem akà Mwol mpɛl ifàlwom làpib. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Ntɔn Mwol wà Dweelà, ikal awà Dweelà a Mwol, ikal ayà nsaay. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Bi banswà, baar ibye anà ntabwey aŋàlwom làpib, bi iwàmumɛɛy làkoo a Mwol, bi ibà aŋàsɔɔmà unsà isii nsil aki, anà làkoo làŋàsöön kölàköl taaŋ lanswà u mbwo a Mwol, awà Dweelà.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'naaŋ a Dweelà anà an'buuŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Ntɔn sye, u mbwo a nsyääm, bi ban'kaar isal aki bi ikwamà anki. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Wɛɛ bi kan'tɔn an'yee a nswɛn, bi, bi ifàsyääl anki impeenà anà bi ifàbübünà anki Ndaa a Nzam, wɛɛ mumɛɛy ndandaa ubwaŋàbwaŋ, waa bi ifàswɛɛŋ bi ŋakwo u nsyeebà a mbuur wanswà kusà a Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Isàkal naa apà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ abi làŋàfwe, la làŋàfwe ntɔn baar bàfàdiimà, <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>ntɔn baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà, waa nzam a mɛɛn mà kàsi làpib unsà un'yɛnà ntɔn baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n aman kyɛɛy a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà làkoo a Klistɔ, awà imɛɛy a Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Ntɔn, kà bi ŋakwo anki bi ifàkyään, wɛɛ bi ifàkyään naa Yɛsu Klistɔ wà Mwol anà bi ŋakwo ibà asyääl abɛ ntɔn Yɛsu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Ntɔn Nzam awà kàtɛn naa: « Pɛɛlà làsànyäŋ uboo a làpib! », wà Nde ŋakwo kànyäŋ u mpem abi, ntɔn ngyööb a làkoo ande ipɛ kyɛɛy u ntabwey a Klistɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Wɛɛ, un'naaŋ awà, bi wa ifàsyen unsà an'buuŋ, ntɔn ngwal aŋàsöönà ayi ikäl yà Nzam, wɛɛ kà yà bi anki. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Bi ibà aŋàküünà mper yanswà, wɛɛ bi kibà aŋàbwanà anki, unsà lingyoomà, wɛɛ bi ilwom anki làkyän, <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>bakyer afilab, wɛɛ bàfikaar anki, bàkyer afidüb, wɛɛ bàfimaay anki, <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>taaŋ lanswà ndür abi ye anà nkweel a Yɛsu ntɔn naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ukäl sye wàŋàmɛnà u ndür abi. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Kyakin, taaŋ lanswà, bi aŋamɔ̈ɔ̈, bàkiyälà kukwà ntɔn Yɛsu, ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a Yɛsu sye umɛnà u ndür abi yukwà. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Abun, ukwà bàmukyer isal amu bi, wɛɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ amu bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Kyekà, asànaa ibà bi anà Dweelà mwɛy la, dweelà a làkwikilà, abun bàsön naa: « Mɛ kàsi làkwikilà, kyakin kàyäm mɛ », bi sye, bi kan'sà làkwikilà, kyakin waa bi iyäämà. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Ntɔn bi ikyàyöb, mbuur kàwiiy Mwol Yɛsu, nde sye akyer afàsiwiiy anà Yɛsu, waa usisà anà bɛ tsütsü apà nde. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Ntɔn indiir abi byanswà byàyi ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn kab a ngway làbɛy, waa làsweey an'tɔɔn a baar mbɔɔn ntɔn làkoo a Nzam.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ unsà làkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Kyakin, bi iyɔn anki, itàkal naa amu bi, imbuur a nsà kyàmutay ikye ikye, imbuur a boo ifàbulà kyàkün ilä a ilä. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Ntɔn, mpay mbɔɔn imanà bi yi, yikaay anà yàlyaŋ, kusà a làkoo a kölàköl là mbul a in'tye kilɔ̈ɔ̈nà mpay mbɔɔn ayi. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Abun, isin a an'kyän abi kà kyà unsà indiir byàfàmɛnà anki, wɛɛ unsà indiir mpa bàfàman. Indiir bàfàman byàfàlam anki, wɛɛ undiir mpa bàfàman byàfàlam mbul a in'tye.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Bi ikyàyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ, isàkal naa ndwà abi u mɛɛn yà ntɛn yan'kwà, bi iwe anà ndwà, ntööŋ a Nzam, ndwà a mbul a in'tye, u du, mpa bàtöŋ kan'kɔɔ a mbuur. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Abun sye bi ibà mufuur koo, unsà ngyal aŋàdiir mubwaar, udu a yumwɛy, ndwà abi yà du, <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>yubwaŋ naa bimɛn bàŋàbwaar, kà bànsàpɔl anki. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Ntɔn, bi baar ibà uboo a ntɛn ayi, bi kan'fuur koo, kan'sil a buur. Ntɔn bi ikwen anki isɔ̈l ipfɛy, wɛɛ ibwäär ipfɛy udu a kyumwɛy, ntɔn undiir afàkwà, mɔ̈ɔ̈ kun'min. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Nzam ŋakwo kilɔ̈ɔ̈n mukal abun, nde kipɛ Dweelà ande asànaa mbööl. <verse eid="2CO 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Lalan bi ibà aŋàyɔl a làkyän taaŋ lanswà. Bi ikyàyöb naa utaaŋ ibà bi uboo a ndür yi, bi ibà u nsà a ndwà abi, ukwɛl a Mwol, <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>ntɔn bi ifàkyà unsà làkwikilà, kunsà mɛɛy anki. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Ndandaa, bi ibà aŋàyɔl a làkyän anà bi iyàkwen mulwomà u ndür yi, ntɔn mukàkal apà Mwol. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Lalan sye bi ikyer ngwal mukun'pà un'sak, itàkal naa bi ibà u ndür ayi, itàkal naa bi kan'too amu ya. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Ntɔn, bi banswà ikyer asàkàmɛnà kusà a làbay a nsaŋ a Klistɔ, ntɔn mbuur mbuur uwɛl kab a indiir kàkyer nde, itàkal amubwaŋ, itàkal amube, utaaŋ kàkäl nde u mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ndür ande.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'tüüb anà Nzam u mbwo a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Abà iyöb bi bɔɔmà a Mwol, bi ifàsyääl mbwo yanswà naa baar bàkyey. Kusà a Nzam, bi ibà aŋàmɛnà ubwaŋàbwaŋ. Mɛ in'sii naa mɛ sye in'wà aŋàmɛnà ubwaŋàbwaŋ unsà an'kyän abɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Apan, bi iyàfàswɛɛŋ anki bi ŋakwo akà bɛ, wɛɛ bi ikwen mukàlapà ipöl bɛ mukal bàngaal ntɔn bi, ntɔn bɛ làkwe mupà mfuur akà baar bàfàsà ngaal aba unsà indiir ifàmɛnà u mii, wɛɛ kà byà boo a mpem anki. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Kyakin isàkal naa bi kàkäl insil, bi kya kàkäl ntɔn Nzam, isàkal naa bi ikàmɛnà asànaa aŋun'yɛnà, yà ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Ukwen a Klistɔ bàmikɔr, bi baar ikyeyà naa ndandaa mbuur mwɛy kàkü ntɔn baar banswà, lalan baar banswà bàkyàkwà. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Nde kàkü ntɔn baar banswà, ntɔn aŋamɔ̈ɔ̈ bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n afàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ntɔn ba ŋakwo, wɛɛ ntɔn mbuur awà kàkü anà kàwiyà ntɔn ba. <verse eid="2CO 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Kyakin, fà apanà bi ifàyöb anki kà mbuur mwɛy unsà imbuur. Isàkal naa bi kàyöb Klistɔ unsà imbuur, apanà bi ifun'yöb anki abun. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Abun sye, isàkal naa mbuur wà amu Klistɔ, nde kan'bulà ikyeer akün. Indiir itaan byan'lyaŋ, le, indiir byanswà byan'bulà byàkün. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Indiir byanswà ifàfà akà Nzam, nde mbuur kàfuur un'tüüb abi anà nde u mbwo a Klistɔ anà kipɛ isal mufuur un'tüüb. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Ntɔn, Nzam kàkäl amu Klistɔ, kàfuur un'tüüb a mɛɛn anà nde ŋakwo, mukɔɔn alab ibii a baar anà musà amu bi ndaa mufuur un'tüüb. <verse eid="2CO 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Abun, bi ibà akyeey ntɔn Klistɔ. Ye asànaa Nzam nde ŋakwo abeelà u mbwo a bi: Kikɔb a Klistɔ, bi kàmàlabɔɔn, wɛy bɛ làfuur un'tüüb anà Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Mbuur mpa kàkyer man'be, Nzam kun'tälà buur a man'be abi, ntɔn amu nde bi ibulà bàbalàbal kusà a Nzam.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Ntɔn bi ibà abaay ande, bi kàmàlalɛɛl mukɔɔn awal kab a ngway a Nzam a bunàbun. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Ntɔn nde an'tɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">« Utaaŋ aŋàbwaŋ, mɛ kàkyer awem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">kilä a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈, mɛ kàkyer abay. »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Le, apanà là taaŋ aŋàbwaŋ. Le, apanà kyilä a ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Bi ikwen anki, itàkal kaben, mubööl mbuur kyà, ntɔn bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n apɛl isal abi. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Wɛɛ akà bi, unsà ya yanswà, bi iswɛɛŋà bi ŋakwo naa ndandaa bi ibà asyääl a Nzam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:4">u mbwo a muküünà mbɔɔn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:4">amu mpay mbɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:4">amu an'kyà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:4">amu bɔɔmà aŋàdiir,<verse eid="2CO 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>amu iki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:5">amu an'bɔlokà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:5">amu lingyoomà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:5">amu yɔ̈ɔ̈n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:5">amu nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a twaal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:5">amu nkiin a isaa,<verse eid="2CO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>u mbwo a pɛɛl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:6">u mbwo a ngyööb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:6">u mbwo a nkääŋ a mpem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:6">u mbwo a ubwaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:6">u mbwo a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:6">u mbwo a ukwen a ndandaa,<verse eid="2CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>u mbwo a ndaa a ndandaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:7">u mbwo a ngwal a Nzam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:7">inwään abi byànwään anà byigyɛɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:7">yà mukyer ndaa a balàbal u mii a Nzam,<verse eid="2CO 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>amu làkoo anà nsaal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:8">amu in'tswe anà nsyäŋà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:8">bàfiwal asànaa aŋatwee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:8">kyekà bi ibà bàndandaa, <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>bàfiwal asànaa biyöb anki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:9">kyekà bàkiyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:9">bàfiwal asànaa akü,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:9">kyekà bi ibà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:9">bàfiwal asànaa baar abuntaaŋàmbar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:9">kyekà bi kàkü anki, <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>bàfiwal asànaa aŋangyɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:10">kyekà taaŋ lanswà bi ibà kun'sak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:10">bàfiwal asànaa aŋàlàmbwà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:10">kyekà bi ifàkyer aŋin'naaŋ mbɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:10">bàfiwal asànaa bi undiir watɛy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:10">kyekà bi ibye anà indiir byanswà!<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Atɔŋ a Kɔlintɔ, bi kàyäm anà bɛ u nsaay yanswà, bi kàladuub mpem abi kölàköl. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Bi kàladübà anki mpem abi, wɛɛ bɛ lidüüb mpem abɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Apanà sye, mɛ in'tɛn a bɛ asànaa akà baan amɛ, bɛ sye làduub mpem abɛ kölàköl!<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igyɛɛŋ akà baar mpa abà Ayudà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Twon lan'tüüb anà baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà. Un'tüüb nà kan'kwo mukäl uboo a balàbal anà ube? Un'tüüb nà uboo a pɛɛlà anà làpib? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Nkwà nà ayà uboo a Klistɔ anà Bɛlyar? Isam nà akyà uboo a ŋàlàkwikilà anà mbuur mpa awà ŋàlàkwikilà? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Undiir nà wun'tüüb uboo a idwà a Nzam anà bànzam a itɛk? Ntɔn bi, bi ibà idwà a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈ asànaa kàtɛn Nzam ŋakwo naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">« Mɛ in'sàkal anà in'sàlyaŋ uboo a ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">mɛ in'sàkal Nzam a ba, ba bàsàkal un'sɛŋ amɛ. »<verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Kyakin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">« Làtoo uboo a baar aban, làkäl ukɔl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">twon lan'ba akà undiir mwɛy wàŋingyäy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">waa mɛ in'sàlawal.<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Mɛ in'sàkal taa ntɔn bɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">waa bɛ làsàkal baan abaal anà bakaar ntɔn mɛ. » Mwol aŋangwal yanswà.<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Nkween amɛ, ntɔn bi kan'kaar ilää a tub abi, bi ipɔŋà bi ŋakwo u ŋingyäy yanswà yà ndür anà yà dweelà. Wɛy bi imay mubulà aŋin'kyɛɛl unsà bɔɔmà a Nzam.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'sak a Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Lipɛ ikal u mpem abɛ! Bi mbuur ube kàkyer anki, bi mbuur kàtay anki, bi undiir a mbuur kàduum anki. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Kà ntɔn mukàlapɛl anki waa mɛ in'tɛɛnà abwɛy, ntɔn mɛ ya kàkyàtàtɛn: bɛ làbà u mpem abi unsà ukwà anà u mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Làkyän amɛ là mbɔɔn amu bɛ, mɛ in'we anà uyɔl mbɔɔn ntɔn bɛ, mɛ in'wà aŋàyɔl a ndɛɛl, mɛ in'wà unsà un'sak mbɔɔn uboo a mpay abi yanswà.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Kyakin, utaaŋ ban'kɔlà bi u Masɛdwan, bi kànyäm anki, bi kàbwey a mpay yifà ifà: ngwiy u nsà, bɔɔmà uboo abi. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Wɛɛ Nzam, mbuur afàlɛɛl bàŋàlàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, nde kàlɛɛl bi u mbwo a ngyeel a Titɔ, <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>kà nà u mbwo a ngyeel ande mpɛl anki, wɛɛ u mbwo a ngwal kàwɛl nde akà bɛ, nde kàkyer isaam ntɔn ukwen abɛ bà ngwal. Nde kiyäm ngyal abɛ yà ngwal, yà nsaaŋ abɛ, yun'kanà abɛ ntɔn mɛ. Ya yanswà yàfan'pà un'sak aŋàsöönà. <verse eid="2CO 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Inye, isàkal naa un'kaan amɛ kàlapɛ ngyɛb, mɛ in'kyɛɛrà anki. Yàlàtàkal naa mɛ in'kyɛɛr, ntɔn mɛ imanà naa un'kaan awà kàlapɛ ngyɛb u taaŋ làmwɛy, <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>apanà mɛ an'man un'sak, kà ntɔn ngyɛb abɛ anki, wɛɛ ntɔn nsɔɔmà kan'bɔr wa. Ntɔn ngyɛb abɛ yàkäl unsà ukwen a Nzam. Kyakin, akà bi, bɛ làsàman anki akà ube mwɛy. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Ntɔn, ngyɛb unsà ukwen a Nzam ifàbɔr nsɔɔmà ayà ifàsyen u ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà ifàwɛy anki ipöl akà nkyɛɛr. Wɛɛ ngyɛb ntɔn mbääb a mɛɛn mà, ifàbɔr ukwà. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Làler apà undiir kàbör ngyɛb akà bɛ unsà ukwen a Nzam:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">muküünà nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">ndwääl a ube nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">ntöön a ube nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">bɔɔmà nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">ilään nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">un'kanà nà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 7:11">ntaaŋàmbar nà! Unsà ndaa ya yanswà bɛ ŋakwo làkyàmɛɛy naa bɛ làbà akuun amu ya. <verse eid="2CO 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Abun, isàkal naa mɛ kàkyer alasöön, kà ntɔn mbɛɛy anki, itàkal kà ntɔn mbuur kàkyer ube anki, itàkal kà ntɔn mbuur bàmukyer ube anki, wɛɛ ntɔn muswaŋ kusà a bɛ, u mii a Nzam, un'kanà abɛ ntɔn bi. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Awà undiir kilɛɛl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Bi kà nà ndɛɛl aŋàyen mpɛl kàwɛl anki, bi kàsäŋ aŋàsöönà muman un'sak anà Titɔ ntɔn lun'tɔɔl bɛ mpem. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa kusà a nde, mɛ kàswɛŋ ngaal ntɔn bɛ, bɛ mɛ nswɛn lan'mɛɛy anki! Wɛɛ, asànaa ifàkyään bi bɛ ndandaa taaŋ lanswà, lalan ngaal kàswɛŋ bi ntɔn bɛ kusà a Titɔ yàmɛnà naa yà ndandaa, <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>ukwen ande akà bɛ bàŋàsöön mbɔɔn, sin sin nde usàyɔbà unkyeey abɛ banswà, ntɔn bɛ lun'wɛl unsà bɔɔmà anà matɛɛr. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Mɛ in'wà unsà un'sak musà làkyän amɛ amu bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbwiiy a indiir ntɔn Ikööŋ a Yuday</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Atɔŋ, bi ikwen naa bɛ làyöb kab a ngway alà kàpɛ Nzam akà Ikööŋ a Masɛdwan. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Itàkal naa ba bàkäl u mpay mbɔɔn, wɛɛ un'sak aba kàkäl mbɔɔn, lalan bàpɛ ba indiir aŋàsöönà, itàkal naa ba bàŋàlàmbwà aŋàdiir. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Mɛ in'wà mbäl: asànaa bään aba, itàkal aŋàsöönà, u mpem aba wanswà, <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>unsà mbɔ̈ɔ̈n yanswà, ba bilɔ̈ɔ̈m, asànaa kab a ngway, mubilà unsà isal mutɔm mbaay akà aŋin'kyɛɛl a Yuday. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Ba bàpɛ yàŋàlyaŋ an'kyän abi: ba bàpɛɛl ba ŋakwo, kusà akà Mwol, ungö akà bi, u mbwo a ukwen a Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Kyakin kàlɛɛl bi Titɔ mumay akà bɛ isal a nkääb aki, asànaa kàsɛmà nde kya. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Wɛɛ, ntɔn bɛ làbà aŋàyɔl mbɔɔn a indiir byanswà, làkwikilà, kab a ndaa, ngyööb anà mbämà yà ifà ifà anà yukwen làwɛl bɛ akà bi, làkäl sye bàŋàyɔl a nkääb ayi. <verse eid="2CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Mɛ kà nswɛɛŋ anki alapaa: wɛɛ alàyäämà mɛ mbämà a baar asin, mɛ amàlapà ipöl mumɛɛy naa ukwen abɛ bà ndandaa. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Ntɔn bɛ làkyayöb kab a ngway a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ: nde mbuur kàkäl ŋun'naaŋ, nde kàbulà ŋàlàmbwà, ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn, u mbwo a làmbwà ande, bɛ làbulà aŋin'naaŋ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>An'kyän amɛ ntɔn nkääb amà: yubwaŋ naa bɛ làsi muküünà, ntɔn bɛ làbà bàtàtwɛb, kà ntɔn mukyer mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye ntɔn muwal an'kyän mukyer isal a nkääb aki sɛmà mbul kàlyaŋ. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Wɛɛ apà, làmaay, mukyer wa, abun nswaal abɛ yàŋàbwaŋ ikäl balàbal sye mumay unsà ukwen abɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Isàkal naa an'kyän mà ndandaa ubwaŋ, Nzam afàkyey kab alà paa, ukɔɔn aler undiir mpa awà paa!<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>An'kyän abi kà mupfiy anki ntɔn un'sak a baar bumwɛy, wɛɛ ntɔn nsöön ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akal uboo a bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Apanà làbà bɛ anà un'naaŋ, bɛ lan'kwo mubay baar ban'kɔɔn wa. Ntɔn sye, ilä làsàkɔɔn bɛ wa anà ba bàsàkal anà wa, ba bàsàlabay. Abun, nsöön isàkal anki uboo a bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Kyakin bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">« Mbuur kàbwe mbɔɔn kàwɛl anki byàŋàsöön,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">mbuur kàbwe ikikye, undiir kàkɔ̈ɔ̈n anki. »<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Titɔ anà atɔŋ ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Mɛ an'fuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam awà kan'sà u mpem a Titɔ un'kanà nsil awà amu bi ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Titɔ kàkyey ndɔ̈ɔ̈m abi, unsà un'kanà wanswà, waa kàkyen mper akà bɛ unsà ukwen ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Mbwo mwɛy anà nde, bi ban'tɔm un'tɔŋ awà bàfàkan Ikööŋ byanswà ntɔn isal ande unsà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Yà sye naa, Ikööŋ byun'sɔ̈ɔ̈l mukal un'baay abi u nkyeen uboo a nkääb ayi, isal ifàkyer bi ntɔn làkoo a Mwol ŋakwo anà muswaŋ an'kyän abi màŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Bi ikal kigyɛɛŋ mutiin an'pɛl unsà nsyääl a un'kàbɔ a ngim ibà bi anà buur awa. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Ntɔn bi, bi ileŋà mukyer ubwaŋ, kusà a Mwol mpɛl anki, wɛɛ kusà a baar sye.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Mbwo mwɛy anà ba, bi ban'tɔm un'tɔŋ abi, awà ifàkyey bi un'kanà ande mbalà mbɔɔn, anà kan'fàswaŋ wa aŋàsöönà, ntɔn nde kan'sà kam akà bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Abun, Titɔ wà mbuur afàtüüb anà mɛ unsà làkwikilà anà un'baay amɛ unsà isal apà bɛ. Ntɔn atɔŋ bumwɛy ban'tüüb mbwo anà nde, ba bà antööm a Ikööŋ, ba bàfàsal ntɔn làkoo a Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Kusà a Ikööŋ, làswɛŋ naa bɛ làbye anà ukwen, naa bi kàkäl anà ibɔŋ muswaŋ ngaal kusà a ba.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkääb ntɔn atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Mfun yatɛy naa mɛ alàsöön ntɔn mbaay akà aŋin'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Mɛ in'kyàyöb an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ abɛ, waa mɛ kàswɛŋ ngaal ntɔn bɛ kusà a baar a Masɛdwan. Mɛ kakyään naa: « Akayi wàŋàyöŋà fà mbul kàlyaŋ », anà un'kanà abɛ kàwiiy nkääb a Ikööŋ mbɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Apan, mɛ amàlatööm atɔŋ naa uyɔl in'we mɛ abà ntɔn bɛ bàkɔɔn akal bàbunàbun unsà ndaa ayin, ntɔn bɛ làkäl bàŋàyöŋà, asànaa kàtɛn mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Abun, mɛ in'yàman bɔɔmà, isàkal naa baar a Masɛdwan ban'yà anà mɛ, anà ba bàmɛn naa bɛ bàŋàtàyöŋà anki, naa mpem ifàlasyeel bi ibulà nswɛn abi, mukɔɔn atɛn naa yà bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Abun, mɛ kàmɛn naa yubwaŋ mulɔm akà atɔŋ abà mufwel akà bɛ kusà a mɛ ntɔn muköŋà an'kab abɛ, isal a an'kab làpɛ bɛ ilää kusà. Kyakin, ma iyàkal màŋàyöŋà utaaŋ in'yàyà mɛ, anà iyàswaŋ naa bɛ làfàpà unsà un'sak, wɛɛ kumpem un'be anki.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Apan, làyöb naa: mbuur afàkɔn ikikye, afàbwo sye ikikye, mbuur afàkɔn mbɔɔn, afàbwo sye mbɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Wɛy mbuur mbuur upɛ asànaa kan'tsul mpem ande, kunkyɛɛr anki, itàkal unkaak a ngwal anki, ntɔn Nzam afàkwen mbuur afàpà unsà un'sak. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Nzam we anà ikɔ̈b mukàlayööl a an'kab a ngway mifà ifà, ntɔn u taaŋ lanswà anà unsà ndaa yanswà, bɛ làwɛl indiir làbà bɛ abyà mfun, anà làfàkal anà indiir aŋàsöönà ntɔn isal aŋàbwaŋ kyanswà, <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>asànaa bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">« Nde kàkyer akab, nde kàpɛ akà aŋàlàmbwà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">balàbal ande lipepey. » <verse eid="2CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Kyekà mbuur afàpà nkɔɔn akà un'köön anà làmpà adyà, asàlapà sye nkɔɔn, nde asàbuul ya mbɔɔn, anà asàyɛɛl mbɛŋ a balàbal abɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Abun, bɛ làyàkal aŋin'naaŋ ntɔn nkääb yanswà, nkääb ifàbɔr an'tɔɔn akà Nzam, u mbwo a bi. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Ntɔn, isal a nkääb aki kà iyàkal ntɔn mumay ngyal aŋin'kyɛɛl mpɛl anki, wɛɛ musweey ngyamàkà a an'tɔɔn mbɔɔn akà Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Mpal bàyàman ba ntal a isal aki, ba bàyàsà Nzam làkoo ntɔn unkyeey làswaŋà bɛ ntɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ a Klistɔ, anà ntɔn nkääb abɛ akà ba anà akà baar banswà. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>U ngyamàkà aba ntɔn bɛ, ba bàyàlaswaŋ ukwen aba, ntɔn kab a ngway aŋàsöön kàlapɛ Nzam. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>An'tɔɔn akà Nzam ntɔn kab ande lifà asin.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl anà isal ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Mɛ, Pɔl, mɛ an'lɔm akà bɛ, unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà ubwaŋ a Klistɔ, - bää mɛ in'fàkal unsà un'kaay u mii abɛ, wɛɛ wàŋàtsim mpal in'fàkal mɛ ukwɛl, <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>mɛ amàlabɔɔn: twon làman'siinà a ngwal utaaŋ in'yàkal mɛ paa, ntɔn ndaa a ngwal in'kwo mɛ muswaŋ akà baar bàfàsi naa nsyeel a mpem abi yunsà imbuur. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Ndandaa, bi ibà baar, wɛɛ bi ifànwan anki unsà ndür. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Ntɔn an'tà ifànwan bi amà kà mimbuur anki, wɛɛ ngwal ama yan'fà akà Nzam ntɔn mubwiy ikal a ngwal. Bi ifàpay an'yweerà an'be, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>anà ngwal yanswà ifàmbäär ngyööb a Nzam. Bi ifàkɔr an'kyän manswà ntɔn ma ikyey Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Bi ibàŋàyöŋà mupà ntaaŋàmbar akà unkwem banswà, umpal làsàmɛy bɛ unkyeey abɛ wàŋàkwo.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Làler indiir asànaa ibyà bya. Isàkal naa we anà mbuur akakyeyà uyɔl naa nde wà Klistɔ, wɛy nde uyweer anà uyöb naa: bi sye ibà bà Klistɔ asànaa nde! <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Abun, itàkal naa mɛ in'we anà uyɔl aŋàsöönà ikye unsà ikɔ̈b kipɛ Mwol ntɔn mutɔŋ, kà ntɔn mudwa anki, mɛ nswɛn in'yàman anki. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Mɛ in'kwen anki mukal anà ifà mupà bɛ bɔɔmà unsà in'kaan amɛ, <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>ntɔn, bàfàtɛn naa: « In'kaan ande myàfàkal ngwal anà myàfàpà bɔɔmà, wɛɛ umpal awà nde paa, nde wàgyɔ̈ɔ̈là, ndaa ande ndöŋ yatɛy. » <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Wɛɛ mbuur akatɛɛnà abwɛy, uyöb ubwaŋ naa: asànaa ibà bi unsà in'kaan abi ukwel, bi sye iyàkal abun u nsyääl abi utaaŋ iyàkal bi uboo a bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Ndandaa, bi ikwe anki musi a baar bumwɛy abà bàfàswɛɛŋ ba ŋakwo. Ba bà insil: ba bàfàwal ba ŋakwo asànaa isii musi a ba ŋakwo. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Wɛɛ akà bi, bi iyàlyaŋ anki isii unsà ngaal ifàswaŋ bi, wɛɛ bi, bi iyàsyääl isii a ndel a isal kisyeel Nzam, mukitwääl sye tii akà bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Ntɔn, bi ilyaŋ anki ndel abi, asànaa bi kàyi anki akà bɛ. Ndandaa bi ibà baar atàtwɛb bàtöl apà bɛ anà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Abun, bi ngaal aŋàsöönà ifàswaŋ anki unsà isal a mbuur asin, wɛɛ bi ibye anà làkyän naa làkwikilà abɛ làsàyɛl, bi iyàfàyɛl aŋàsöönà uboo a bɛ, unsà ndel a isal abi, <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ uboo a itiir abyukwel anà bɛ, mukɔɔn aswaŋ ngaal unsà isal bàkyer u ywaŋ a baar asin. <verse eid="2CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Apan sye, bàsön naa: « Wɛy mbuur aswaŋà ngaal, uswɛŋ ngaal ande unsà Mwol. »<verse eid="2CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Abun, kà bàfàkyey mbuur afàswɛɛŋ nde ŋakwo anki, wɛɛ mbuur awà ufàswɛɛŋ Mwol.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl anà antööm a loor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Aa! Mɛ amàlabɔɔn mukaŋ mpem ntɔn undiir akamɛnà asànaa kikɔŋ amɛ! Ndandaa, làkäŋ mpem ntɔn mɛ! <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Mɛ in'we anà un'köl ntɔn bɛ, un'köl kan'fà akà Nzam, ntɔn mɛ kàlatɛɛl ntüün a baal mwɛy mpɛl, ntɔn mukàlaswaŋ akà Klistɔ asànaa un'kaar mpa aŋàtàyöb baal, wàŋàpɔŋà. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Wɛɛ, mɛ in'we anà bɔɔmà muman naa an'kyän abɛ itäy anà ukwen abɛ ntɔn Klistɔ bàdiimà, asànaa ntäy kàkür nde Ɛva u mbwo a impeenà ande. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Kyakin, bɛ làkyer akyeyà ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa mbuur mwɛy uyàlakyään Yɛsu a nsöön a Nde akwà kàlakyään bi. Bɛ làfàkyey sye muwal dweelà anà làsaŋ a nsöön a Dweelà anà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ làwɛl bɛ akà bi.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Kyekà, mɛ in'sii naa mɛ kin'wà kimbuur anki kusà a antööm akwà bàfàkyey naa ba bà baar a baar. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Isàkal naa mɛ in'kwo anki unsà tweey, wɛɛ mɛ in'we anà ngyööb. Bi bàkyàlaswaŋ yanswà ubwaŋàbwaŋ amu indiir byanswà.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Nkye mɛ kàkyer man'be mutyà mɛ ŋakwo ntɔn bɛ làlär, umpal kàlakyään mɛ a ngway Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ a Nzam? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Mɛ kàmay un'naaŋ a Ikööŋ byumwɛy, muwal làfur akà ba ntɔn musyääl bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Umpal kàkäl mɛ akà bɛ, anà kàkäl mɛ anà ngyal a undiir, mɛ kàpɛ anki buur amɛ kan'kɔɔ a mbuur mwɛy, ntɔn atɔŋ bàfü Masɛdwan ban'pɛ undiir wanswà kàkäl mɛ awà mfun. Unsà ya yanswà, mɛ kàkäl kigyɛɛŋ mukɔɔn akal buur ntɔn bɛ, mɛ in'yàlalà abun ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>U mbwo a ndandaa a Klistɔ ayà amu mɛ, mɛ an'kyey naa: kà mbuur mwɛy watɛy kan'duum ndaa a làkoo ayi kitiir a Akayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Ntɔn nkye? Ntɔn mɛ bɛ kàlakwen anki? Nzam akyàyöb!<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Abun, mɛ in'yàlalà mukyer asànaa in'kakyerà mɛ apanà, ntɔn mudübà mbwo akà baar bàleŋà mbwo mukyey uyɔl naa ba bà asànaa bi! <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Ntɔn baar aban bà antööm a loor, baar a isal a loor bàŋàyee ungö a antööm a Klistɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Wa kundiir a ubem anki: Satanà ŋakwo afàyee amu un'kyeey a pɛɛlà. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Abun, kundiir a kölàköl anki ntɔn asyääl ande bàyee uboo a asyääl a balàbal. Ntsüü aba isàkal asànaa isal aba.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpay kàmɛn Pɔl.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Mɛ an'fàfuur, mbuur twon an'si naa mɛ in'wà ŋukɔŋ. Itàkal abwɛy, làkyey naa mɛ in'käl ŋukɔŋ, ntɔn mɛ sye in'kyey ndam a uyɔl. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Ayà in'kwen mɛ mutɛn, kasànaa ukwen Mwol anki, wɛɛ asànaa ŋukɔŋ, ntɔn ya yà ntɔn muswaŋ ngaal. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Ntɔn bàmbɔɔn bàfàswaŋ ngaal unsà ndaa a imbuur, mɛ sye in'swaŋ ngaal. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Bɛ aŋan'yeerà, bɛ làfàkyey baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n an'yeerà ukɔɔn apeen. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Abun, bɛ làfàkaŋ mpem naa bàlabuul asɔ, bàlamɛɛy ntaan, bàlapfiy, bàlasaal, bàlakäm mbar u ntabwey. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Mɛ in'wà u nswɛn mutɛn naa: bi kàswɛŋ naa bi ibà aŋagyɔ̈ɔ̈là.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kyekà, mbuur usàkyer kyääl mutɛn, - mɛ in'tɛn asànaa ŋukɔŋ - mɛ sye in'kyer kyääl mutɛn. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Nkye ba bà Bɛbɛlyɔ? Anà mɛ sye. Nkye ba bà Bisàlɛl? Anà mɛ sye. Nkye ba bikyee a Abàlam? Anà mɛ sye. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Nkye ba basyääl a Klistɔ? Mɛ in'tɛn asànaa ŋukɔŋ, mɛ in'wà aŋàsöön ba! Ntɔn, mɛ kàmɛn mpay aŋàsöönà, mɛ kàbilà bɔlokà mbalà mbɔɔn, mɛ ban'düb aŋàsöönà mbɔɔn, mbalà mbɔɔn mɛ kàbweey a igɔnsà a ukwà. <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Ayudà ban'käm iki an'kwem an'tär aŋiwà mbalà tyeen, <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>an'füm mbalà tär, in'kul mbalà mwɛy, mɛ kàminà kan'dà mbalà tär, mɛ kàkyer mwäänà mwɛy anà mpib mwɛy uboo a ngyäl. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Mbalà mbɔɔn mɛ kàkäl u nkyeen kin'kɔl, mɛ kàbweey a igɔnsà mbɔɔn: igɔnsà a ngyäl, igɔnsà a baar abɛ, igɔnsà a atɔŋ a itoo amɛ, igɔnsà a baar mpa abà Ayudà, igɔnsà uboo a an'bul, igɔnsà u nsye a ipɔl, igɔnsà udu a ngyäl anà igɔnsà uboo a atɔŋ a loor, <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>amu yɔ̈ɔ̈n anà mpay mbɔɔn, mbalà mbɔɔn ukɔɔn twaal, amu ngyal anà mfyää, mbalà mbɔɔn amu nkin a isaa, amu mpye anà làmbwà. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Ukɔɔn aler indiir byumwɛy, buur amɛ bilä a ilä bà nkyɛɛr ntɔn ikööŋ byanswà. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Nà awe anà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là, waa mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n gyɔ̈ɔ̈là? Nà kan'bwà u man'be, waa mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n akyɛɛr?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Isàkal naa mɛ in'swaŋ ngaal, mɛ ngaal in'swaŋ unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là amɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Nzam, Taar a Mwol Yɛsu, awàŋasaak ntɔn mbul a in'tye, akyàyöb naa mɛ loor in'taa anki. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Mpal kàkäl mɛ u Damas, kuvernɔ̈ɔ̈r kàkäl un'kyeey a mfum Arɛtas kàsi aseey u minàmbwo a bul ntɔn mukan'kɔr. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Wɛɛ, u mbwo a mun a nɛl a ibää a làpaŋ, laa ban'tyeey ba uboo a un'tɛr, waa mɛ kàsɔrà kan'kɔɔ ande.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Iman mii a Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Nkye yubwaŋ muswaŋ ngaal? Ŋaa, ndöŋ yatɛy! Wɛɛ apanà, wɛy mɛ in'tɛn ntɔn ndaa kan'swɛŋ Mwol u imanmii anà u imɛɛy. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Mɛ in'yöb mbuur mwɛy amu Klistɔ awà, yan'lyaŋ mbul kwem aŋinà, bun'syeen tii u du làtär, nkye yàkäl amu ndür ande? mɛ in'yöb anki, nkye yàkäl u nsà a ndür ande? mɛ in'yöb anki, Nzam ayöb ya. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Ndandaa, mɛ in'yöb naa mbuur awà, - nkye yàkäl amu ndür ande? nkye yàkäl anki amu ndür ande? mɛ in'yöb anki, Nzam ayöb ya, - <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>bun'syen tii u paladisɔ, waa kàwem ndaa mpa bàfàbuul, ndaa mpa bàpɛ mbuur mbwo muywel ya. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Ntɔn mbuur atub awunà mɛ in'swaŋ ngaal, wɛɛ ntɔn mɛ, mɛ ngaal amɛ in'yàswaŋ nà unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là amɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Yàlàkal naa mɛ in'kwen muswaŋ ngaal, mɛ kàlàkal anki ŋukɔŋ, ntɔn mɛ kàlàtɛn ndandaa. Wɛɛ mɛ an'tɔn mukyer abun, ntɔn mukɔɔn aman amu mɛ an'kyän aŋàsöön amà bàfàman ba itàkal bàfàwem ba akà mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Apan sye, ntɔn mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n ayɔl a uyɔl ntɔn kàwɛl mɛ imɛɛy kyan'söön ubwaŋ, ban'si itoor u ndür, asànaa un'kyeey a Satanà bàsɔ̈ɔ̈l mukan'düb anà mukan'dübà mbwo mukyey uyɔl. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Mɛ kàbɔ̈ɔ̈n Mwol mbalà tär ntɔn mukan'lwom itoor aki. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Wɛɛ nde kan'fuur naa: « Kab a ngway amɛ lan'kwo akà ngye, ntɔn ngwal amɛ ifàmɛnà yàŋàkwo unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là. » Abun, unsà un'sak wanswà, mɛ in'yàswaŋ ngaal amɛ unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là amɛ, ntɔn ngwal a Klistɔ ikäl amu mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Kyakin un'sak amɛ wamu gyɔ̈ɔ̈là, amu in'tswe, amu in'siinà, amu nkwaaŋ anà amu bɔɔmà aŋàdiir ntɔn Klistɔ. Ntɔn umpal in'wà mɛ unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là, apan sye in'wà mɛ anà ngwal.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyɛɛr a Pɔl ntɔn Bàkɔlintɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Le mɛ an'bulà ŋukɔŋ! Bɛ lan'siinà a ngwal, bɛ baar làlan'tɛɛl imbäl. Ntɔn, itàkal naa mɛ in'wà undiir a bunàbun, mɛ kin'wà anki u ngyɛl a antööm abà bàfàmɛnà naa ba bà udu. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Idiim abyà ifàswaŋ naa mbuur wà ntööm byàmɛnà uboo abɛ: nkääŋ a mpem unsà ndɛb yanswà, idiim, impà anà isal a ngwal. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Undiir nà bɛ mpa làwɛl asànaa ikööŋ byumwɛy, nà mɛ mukɔɔn akal buur ntɔn bɛ? Lan'dwääl nkul ntɔn nkɔ̈ɔ̈n a balàbal ayi! <verse eid="2CO 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Le, mɛ in'wà tsütsü muyà akà bɛ mbalà yàtär, anà mɛ in'yàkal anki buur abɛ: ntɔn mɛ in'lɛŋà anki indiir abɛ, wɛɛ bɛ ŋakwo. Kà buur a baan anki musà indiir ukɔl ntɔn aböör, wɛɛ aböör ntɔn baan. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Ntɔn mɛ, mɛ in'pà indiir amɛ byanswà anà mɛ ŋakwo wanswà ntɔn bɛ. Isàkal naa mɛ in'fàlakwen mbɔɔn, nkye mɛ bàyan'kwen ikikye? <verse eid="2CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Itàkal naa mɛ kàkäl anki buur ntɔn bɛ, wɛɛ bàtɛn naa mɛ in'wà ikur baar, waa mɛ kàlakör u mbwo a impeenà. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Aben, nkye mɛ kàkyer alapfiy u mbwo a umwɛy uboo a baar kàlatööm mɛ? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Mɛ kàlɔ̈m akà Titɔ muyà akà bɛ, anà mɛ kàtöm mbwo mwɛy anà nde un'tɔŋ awà làyöb bɛ. Nkye Titɔ kàkyer alapfiy? Nkye nde anà mɛ, bi kàkäl anki an'kyän an'mwɛy, anà mulab mbwo mwɛy? <verse eid="2CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Fà itaan, nkye bɛ làsii naa bi ifàtwey balàbal bi ŋakwo kusà a bɛ? Ŋaa, bi ifàyäm kusà a Nzam, amu Klistɔ. Indiir abi byanswà, nkwen amɛ, byà ntɔn làkwikilà abɛ làyɛl. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Abun, bɔɔmà amɛ bà naa, umpal in'yàyà mɛ, mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n ayàlaman asànaa in'kwen mɛ, naa bɛ sye làkɔ̈ɔ̈n akan'man asànaa làkwen bɛ. Mɛ in'manà bɔɔmà naa mɛ in'yàtaan uboo a bɛ: an'sye, un'köl, nkyɛl, isür, ntwee, itetɛɛn, in'tswe anà lingwoomà. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Mɛ imanà bɔɔmà naa in'yàfàyà mɛ, Nzam amɛ ayàmɛɛy nswɛn kusà abɛ, anà mɛ in'lel ntɔn bàmbɔɔn abà bàkyer man'be kusà anà mpa bàbuul mpem u ŋingyääy, u ndaa a nswɛn anà unsà induumà bàkyer ba.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ a ntsüü anà mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Yi mbalà yàtär in'yà mɛ akà bɛ. Asànaa bàsön ya naa: « Ndaa yanswà bàyàtsul unsà imbäl a baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l itàkal atär. » <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Mɛ kàkyàtàtɛn kusà, asànaa umpal kayi mɛ mbalà yàyweel, mɛ in'fàfuur ya ŋàbawà mpa in'wà mɛ paa, akà baar bàkyer man'be kusà anà akà bumwɛy: isàkal naa mɛ an'fàyà, mɛ akà mbuur mwɛy in'sàyee anki, <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>ntɔn bɛ làleŋà isii naa Klistɔ afàyäm amu mɛ. Nde kà wàgyɔ̈ɔ̈là anki kusà a bɛ, wɛɛ nde afàswaŋ ngwal amu bɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Ndandaa, nde bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là ande, wɛɛ nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u ngwal a Nzam. Bi sye ibà bàgyɔ̈ɔ̈là amu nde, wɛɛ bi isàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà nde u ngwal a Nzam ntɔn bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Làpɛl bɛ ŋakwo, làler naa nkye bɛ làbà uboo a làkwikilà, làler bɛ ŋakwo ubwaŋàbwaŋ. Nkye bɛ làfàkayöbà anki naa Yɛsu Klistɔ wà amu bɛ? Nà isàkal naa bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n awal iböŋ unsà ndeer ayi. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Apan, mɛ an'sà làkyän naa bɛ làkyer asàyöb naa bi, bi kàbü anki kusà a ndeer ayi. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Bi ifàyamà Nzam naa bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n akyer akà ube mwɛy. Bi ikwen anki mumɛɛy iböŋ abi, wɛɛ muman naa bɛ lan'kyer ubwaŋ, itàkal naa bi ikamɛnà bàŋàkwàndwà. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Ntɔn bi ikɔ̈b mumbäär ndandaa kyatɛy, wɛɛ bi iwe anà ikɔ̈b mukölà kya mpɛl. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Wɛɛ bi ibà unsà un'sak, taaŋ lanswà ibà bi bàgyɔ̈ɔ̈là anà làbà bɛ aŋangwal. Waa bi ikalɔɔmà u ngyamàkà abi naa bɛ làbulà bàŋàkwo. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Kyakin, amàlasöön mɛ ndaa ayi yanswà umpal in'wà mɛ ukwel, ntɔn umpal in'sàyà mɛ, ya ikɔ̈ɔ̈n amɛnà naa ndaa amɛ yà bwoor musyääl ikɔ̈b kan'pɛ Mwol ntɔn mutɔŋ, kà ntɔn mudwa anki.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Atɔŋ, làkäl unsà un'sak, làsäl ntɔn mukwo, làpɛɛl ngwal bɛ a bɛ, làkäl an'kyän an'mwɛy, làkäl unsà duu, waa Nzam a ukwen anà duu uyàkal anà bɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Làpɛɛl mbɔr u mbwo a ndüür in'kyɛɛl.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà bàmàlapà mbɔr.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Wɛy kab a ngway a Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ, ukwen a Nzam, anà un'tüüb a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl byàkäl anà bɛ banswà.<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
